The T035 pipeline tests still fail, but only on `result.json` / terminal `agent_result` assertions — those are produced by the **T031** finalizer wiring (`invocation_result.py` + `agent_stream.py`), a separate non-[P] task on different files. Its reconciliation core (`reconcile_result`/`ResultFinalizer`) already exists and passes; T031 is what consumes the `producer.json` this task now emits. I kept the change scoped to `proposer.sh` as the task specifies. T030's checkbox is flipped to `[x]`.
